please start a new email thread every time you want to talk about a new
topic otherwise people may not see your message at all.


I am not aware of any specific group working on security in batman-adv
at the moment.

Personally I always try to find a solution to this problem on a
different layer other than batman-adv (e.g. by using IBSS-RSN on the
wifi layer).

However it depends on what your specific goal is. I think that "security
on batman-adv" is quite a broad topic that you may need to clarify.


